### Available Patterns

- **Shared Kernel** — Shared types used by both contexts (sparingly)
- **Customer-Supplier** — One context provides; the other consumes
- **Anti-Corruption Layer** — Translation boundary to protect context integrity
- **Domain Events** — Loose coupling via events (application-layer orchestration in Rust)
